{"id":"8c2636b7f029a7c9","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-random-condition.md","title":"ZFC Random Condition","display":"df-zfc-random-condition — ZFC Random Condition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-random-condition","aliases":["58-df-zfc-random-condition"],"display":"df-zfc-random-condition — ZFC Random Condition","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-borel-set]]","[[58-df-probability-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-random-condition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-random-condition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-random-condition — ZFC Random Condition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dedfc8e5804658ad\" href=\"?note=dedfc8e5804658ad\" title=\"58-df-borel-set\">58-df-borel-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"58-df-probability-space\">58-df-probability-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,\\tau_{2^\\omega},\\lambda_{2^\\omega}\\in V\">\\(B,\\tau_{2^\\omega},\\lambda_{2^\\omega}\\in V\\)</span>, where <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{2^\\omega}\">\\(\\tau_{2^\\omega}\\)</span> is the standard product topology and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda_{2^\\omega}\">\\(\\lambda_{2^\\omega}\\)</span> is the coin-flip product measure</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Borel}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{Borel}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_{2^\\omega}(\\tau_{2^\\omega})\\in V\">\\(\\sigma_{2^\\omega}(\\tau_{2^\\omega})\\in V\\)</span> are from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dedfc8e5804658ad\" href=\"?note=dedfc8e5804658ad\" title=\"58-df-borel-set\">58-df-borel-set</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> is from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"58-df-probability-space\">58-df-probability-space</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RandomCondition}_S:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{RandomCondition}_S:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^n\">\\(2^n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 为集合函数载体；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in2^n\">\\(s\\in2^n\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cylinder}_{58}(s)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cylinder}_{58}(s)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CoinFlipProbability}_{58}(\\mu)\">\\(\\mathrm{CoinFlipProbability}_{58}(\\mu)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{2^\\omega}\">\\(\\tau_{2^\\omega}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda_{2^\\omega}\">\\(\\lambda_{2^\\omega}\\)</span> 由正文定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\{\\mathrm{Cylinder}_{58}(s):n\\in\\omega\\land s\\in2^n\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C=\\{\\mathrm{Cylinder}_{58}(s):n\\in\\omega\\land s\\in2^n\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_C=\\sigma_{2^\\omega}(\\tau_{2^\\omega})\">\\(\\Sigma_C=\\sigma_{2^\\omega}(\\tau_{2^\\omega})\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 沿用所引 Borel 生成算子。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}2^n\\ \\to\\\n\\mathrm{Cylinder}_{58}(s)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in2^\\omega:s\\subseteq x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\in\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}2^n\\ \\to\\\n\\mathrm{Cylinder}_{58}(s)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in2^\\omega:s\\subseteq x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{2^\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{U\\subseteq2^\\omega:\\exists\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\mathcal C\\;(U=\\bigcup\\mathcal U)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau_{2^\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{U\\subseteq2^\\omega:\\exists\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\mathcal C\\;(U=\\bigcup\\mathcal U)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CoinFlipProbability}_{58}(\\mu)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(2^\\omega,\\Sigma_C,\\mu)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall s\\in2^n\\;\n\\mu(\\mathrm{Cylinder}_{58}(s))=2^{-n}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CoinFlipProbability}_{58}(\\mu)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(2^\\omega,\\Sigma_C,\\mu)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall s\\in2^n\\;\n\\mu(\\mathrm{Cylinder}_{58}(s))=2^{-n}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists!\\mu\\in[0,1]^{\\Sigma_C}\\;\\mathrm{CoinFlipProbability}_{58}(\\mu).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists!\\mu\\in[0,1]^{\\Sigma_C}\\;\\mathrm{CoinFlipProbability}_{58}(\\mu).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda_{2^\\omega}\\coloneqq\\bigcup\\{\\mu\\in[0,1]^{\\Sigma_C}:\\mathrm{CoinFlipProbability}_{58}(\\mu)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda_{2^\\omega}\\coloneqq\\bigcup\\{\\mu\\in[0,1]^{\\Sigma_C}:\\mathrm{CoinFlipProbability}_{58}(\\mu)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}random\\text{-}condition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RandomCondition}_S(B)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Borel}_S(B,2^\\omega,\\tau_{2^\\omega})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}\n(2^\\omega,\\sigma_{2^\\omega}(\\tau_{2^\\omega}),\\lambda_{2^\\omega})\n\\land 0&lt;\\lambda_{2^\\omega}(B).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}random\\text{-}condition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RandomCondition}_S(B)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Borel}_S(B,2^\\omega,\\tau_{2^\\omega})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}\n(2^\\omega,\\sigma_{2^\\omega}(\\tau_{2^\\omega}),\\lambda_{2^\\omega})\n\\land 0&lt;\\lambda_{2^\\omega}(B).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both Borel membership and positive measure are now guarded by the same explicitly selected standard probability space; the measure and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-algebra are not free ambient conventions.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-borel-set","status":"resolved","id":"dedfc8e5804658ad","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-borel-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-probability-space","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-probability-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-borel-set","status":"resolved","id":"dedfc8e5804658ad","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Borel}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ and $\\sigma_{2^\\omega}(\\tau_{2^\\omega})\\in V$ are from [[58-df-borel-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-probability-space","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ is from [[58-df-probability-space]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"B,\\tau_{2^\\omega},\\lambda_{2^\\omega}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{2^\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda_{2^\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Borel}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_{2^\\omega}(\\tau_{2^\\omega})\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RandomCondition}_S:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"2^n","display":false},{"tex":"2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in2^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cylinder}_{58}(s)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CoinFlipProbability}_{58}(\\mu)"